@lebaphi   - since the above `useCallback` doesn't have any props, it won't get called if `selectedAssets` changes.  Am I mistaken

(this is the first time I've  worked with `useCallback` - so I'm guessing what is happening)

Yes, I've just tested this.   If we select an asset from the `own forces` tab, the map zooms in, but the asset doesn't start flashing.

